          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping information",
            "content": "<p>We ship most orders within 1-3 business days after the order is placed unless the item is a Pre-Order, Custom Product, or Made-to-Order. </p><p>We ship from Plano, TX - transit times will vary depending on distance from our shipping location.</p><p>Orders $65+ qualify for free USPS First Class Shipping.<br/><br/>Upgraded shipping options are available at checkout for faster transit times (FedEx Ground, 2nd Day, or Overnight). </p><p></p><p>**PLEASE NOTE, expediting shipping does not expedite processing or production time.</p>",
